WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Sikh tradition tells of a visit by the
Mughal Emperor Akbar to Guru Amar Das,

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.330
the third Guru.

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:11.690
But first, a rule: everyone who came to
see the Guru had to sit on the floor and

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.260
eat with everyone.

5
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.670
The story says the emperor did.

6
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.090
So why make an emperor sit on
the floor and eat with everyone?

7
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.870
In this mission, you'll
trace this free meal,

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.400
langar, from Guru Nanak to Guru Amar Das.

9
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:30.080
Then you'll see who cooks,
serves and scrubs the pots,

10
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.730
and three kinds of service they give.

11
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:37.680
Your mission: find out why an emperor had
to sit on the floor and eat with everyone

12
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.160
before meeting a Guru.
